From: Guohan Lu <securely1g@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Record the exact Common source revision in its module version

The source repository owns the build and packaging implementation. Change
only the registry identity so consumers select this immutable source commit.

--- a/MODULE.bazel
+++ b/MODULE.bazel
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 # Keep bazel_compatibility in sync with sonic-buildimage's .bazelversion.
 module(
     name = "sonic-swss-common",
-    version = "0.0.4",
+    version = "0.0.4-0a6bcb556a522b2a1851678a753c6164fcf6c412",
     bazel_compatibility = [
         ">=8.5.1",
         "<=8.5.1",
